#: resources/views/modules/descendants-chart/form/details.phtml:59
msgid ""
"Selecting a person shows the birth, the death with places and the facts that "
"the tree names for the chart box (\"Other facts to show in charts\") in a "
"panel that slides in over the chart. A click then selects a person instead "
"of opening the chart for them, and the panel offers both actions."
msgstr ""
"Selecting a person shows the birth, the death with places and the facts that "
"the tree names for the chart box (\"Other facts to show in charts\") in a "
"panel that slides in over the chart. A click then selects a person instead "
"of opening the chart for them, and the panel offers both actions."

